                    <h3 class="hp-cost-type">Large Projects</h3>
                    <span class="hp-cost-range">$1,500 - $5,000+</span>
                </div>
                <p class="hp-cost-desc">New construction, second-story additions, and major structural changes require the most extensive review. These projects need architect-stamped drawings, structural engineering calculations, and often a series of inspections at every stage of construction from foundation to final.</p>
                <ul class="hp-cost-list">
                    <li>New home construction</li>
                    <li>Second-story addition</li>
                    <li>Detached ADU/granny flat</li>
                    <li>Complete gut renovation</li>
